  "remarks": "PJSC “BystroBank” is is the leading regional bank in the Udmurt Republic of \nthe Russian Federation. The bank is involved in implementing the \npreferential car loan program launched by the Government of the Russian \nFederation. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to \nthe Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, PJSC “BystroBank” is \ninvolved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to \nthe Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the \nannexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
